      "role": "user",
      "content": "\"let it be...\" i guess. but the silence feels so heavy. it's like i'm a ghost. i look in the mirror and i don't even see a person anymore, just a leftover from a life that's already over. i spent so much time being essential, and now that i'm not... it feels like the universe is just waiting for me to realize i'm not needed anymore. like i've already finished my part in the story and i'm just a lingering footnote.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
